{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NUHnePDlkq1795732333.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市場擔心中東原油供應再受阻，原油期貨價格上升。</p><p></p><p>倫敦期油收市報96.57美元一桶，升1.96美元，升幅百分之2。紐約期油因感恩節假期，沒有結算價。</p><p></p><p>此外，石油輸出國組織將於星期日舉行線上會議，《彭博》報道，油組正考慮把當前的原油產量配額延續至明年1月。但伊拉克方面提出異議，該國一直希望提高產量。阿聯酋就因為對自身產量限制不滿，今年5月退出油組。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:44:18.070834+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T22:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T00:57:15.612863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:37:36.330921+00:00","content_hash":"5995fc7c4e18a180e24c5bb77c92e6eba7fd0d8eaa03c2ce82ef26f9b6ac986e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:44:18.070834+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}